{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Project Spiritualiteit en Maatschappelijke Vernieuwing"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:59858"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"E.H. Hense"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Radboud Universiteit Nijmegen"},"authorIdentifierScheme":{"typeName":"authorIdentifierScheme","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"DAI"},"authorIdentifier":{"typeName":"authorIdentifier","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"info:eu-repo\/dai\/nl\/071809481"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"E. H.  Hense"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Radboud Universiteit"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Spiritualiteit en maatschappelijke vernieuwing - negen initiatieven van maatschappelijke vernieuwing rond eten, zorg en geld in Nederland.<\/p><p>Vanuit hun persoonlijke toe-eigening van een gegeven maatschappelijk probleem en hun eigen creatieve vermogen om de dingen anders aan te pakken, dragen vernieuwers in Nederland bij aan een andere inrichting van de samenleving rond de thema’s eten, zorg en geld. Wie zijn bij deze initiatieven betrokken, wat doen zij precies, hoe doen zij dat en waartoe leidt dit?<\/p><p>Deze vragen worden per initiatief in detail onderzocht. Deze initiatieven zijn: Uit Je Eigen Stad, Hotspot Hutspot, Thuis Afgehaald, Zorgcoöperatie Hoogeloon, Unal zorg, Eigen Kracht Centrale, Stro, Qoin en Money Money Money.<\/p><p>De data van dit project bestaat uit transcripties van afgenomen interviews. Ieder interview vormt een eigen dataset met en heeft een eigen persistent identifier. Behalve de transcriptie van het desbetreffende interview vindt u ook de volgende bestanden:<br>- List of files: de lijst met alle interviews van het project (.pdf)<br>- Readme documentation: de onderzoeksbeschrijving voor het hele project. (.pdf)<br>Deze twee bestanden zijn ook toegevoegd aan deze dataset.<\/p><p>De links naar de interviews zijn te vinden in 'Relation or Related Material'. Twee interviews (Glashouwers en Van Beek) zijn beschikbaar zodra u een aanvraag doet en deze wordt gehonoreerd door de deposant. <\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Spiritualiteit"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Maatschappelijke vernieuwing"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Zorg"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Eten"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Geld"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Levenskwaliteit"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Waarden"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Zorg voor het zelf"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Reflexieve praktijken"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Voorbeeldige houdingen en attitudes"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-06-25"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2014-11-19"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2014-11-19"}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Radboud Universiteit Nijmegen, E.H. Hense"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D33000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D32000"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Social sciences"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Sociale wetenschappen"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D33000","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Theology and religious studies"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Godgeleerdheid en religiewetenschappen"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/clas